# <type>(<scope>): <subject>   # <= ~60 chars, imperative ("add", not "added")
#
# <body: what and why, wrapped at 72 cols. Expected for non-trivial work.>
#
# type:  feat fix refactor perf docs test build ci chore
# scope: api web extension schema deploy
#
# Rules enforced by .githooks/commit-msg:
#   - subject >= 10 chars, not a bare number or placeholder
#   - one logical change per commit (split deploy work from homepage edits)
